sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant OS
    participant Router as DeepLinkRouter
    participant Auth as AuthGate (Ch 21)
    participant Nav as Navigation (Ch 53)
    participant API as Authed API (Ch 19/23)

    User->>OS: open https://streamcart.com/order/456 (App Link)
    OS->>Router: resolve(uri) on cold start
    Router->>Router: validate params (untrusted)
    Router->>Auth: requiresAuth(Order)? yes, logged out
    Auth->>Nav: navigate(Login, pending = Order/456)
    User->>Nav: logs in
    Nav->>Nav: resume -> Order/456 + synth back stack (Home)
    Nav->>API: GET order/456 (Bearer) -> server authorizes (IDOR-safe)
    API-->>Nav: order (only if it belongs to this user)
